# Generated reports. Two are committed deliberately, because documentation cites
# their numbers and CI regenerates them to prove the numbers are current:
#   reports/metrics.json     - the quality metrics referenced by README.md
#   reports/benchmarks.json  - the benchmark results referenced by BENCHMARKS.md
reports/*
!reports/metrics.json
!reports/benchmarks.json

